{"951770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forsaken Realms: Vahrin's Call", "steam_appid": 951770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4982930], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/54edadf5954952f8c8d9141424a3b9e6.avif?t=1787230575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/54edadf5954952f8c8d9141424a3b9e6.webp?t=1787230575 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise weapons, armour, abilities, alchemy ingredients, traps and anything else you can lay your hands on within an entirely classless character progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to be a nimble-footed archer flinging fireballs between arrows or face your foes, toe to toe as an axe-wielding whirlwind of death; the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/77cf3d53361ddf2f67d82d4be3c978f7.poster.avif?t=1787230575\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/77cf3d53361ddf2f67d82d4be3c978f7.webm?t=1787230575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/808b56b5b674ab9643a7658d59d7fb80.avif?t=1787230575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/808b56b5b674ab9643a7658d59d7fb80.webp?t=1787230575 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vale of Vahrin is beset by threats from both within and without, the perfect place for a mercenary in search of their next contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival mercenaries, bandits, monstrous beasts and even hideous creatures infest the Vale of Vahrin, ready and waiting for their bounties to be claimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master intense real-time action combat and adapt to every challenge, ensuring that no enemy, no matter how powerful, can stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/52bc2aa0694375f4ceaa2044525e6770.poster.avif?t=1787230575\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/52bc2aa0694375f4ceaa2044525e6770.webm?t=1787230575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid the survivors in their personal tales of grief, love and even humour, as they fight back against the overwhelming odds facing Vahrin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a world steeped in beauty and mystery, from overgrown city streets to magical caverns and murky bogs, each hand-crafted to test your resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour every corner; leaving no stone unturned in your quest to discover hidden treasures, unravel lost mysteries, and claim the spoils of Vahrin for your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/df92191111505052e9d0523169c0ed14.poster.avif?t=1787230575\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/df92191111505052e9d0523169c0ed14.webm?t=1787230575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/c5ad57ce163ad76bf70af26dae5adfcf.avif?t=1787230575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/c5ad57ce163ad76bf70af26dae5adfcf.webp?t=1787230575 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city of Vahrin found itself overwhelmed by a swarm of the grotesque, insect-like creatures known as khraiax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In response, many of the Free Cities, united under the banner of the Combined Order, sent their armies to confront this terrible threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But victory was not to be theirs, for while the khraiax stood little chance against the might of the combined forces, a far greater danger rose from beneath the city’s streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vahrin’s king lies dead, along with thousands of soldiers who marched to the city’s aid. Now only its most stalwart defenders remain, desperately fighting to reclaim their beloved home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/277c0b20df931165d4c7b0cb68da053b.poster.avif?t=1787230575\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/277c0b20df931165d4c7b0cb68da053b.webm?t=1787230575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/4ba91c0ce7ed2e133faab236a270e486.avif?t=1787230575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/4ba91c0ce7ed2e133faab236a270e486.webp?t=1787230575 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vahrin’s Call stands as its own complete tale, yet it forms just one part of a sweeping epic narrative that spans nations and continents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as smaller, isolated struggles becomes part of a greater saga, where every character’s trial, every kingdom’s war, and every act of courage or betrayal weaves the tapestry of the unfolding story throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/3977124f25d053f5ddc9f7047a192528.poster.avif?t=1787230575\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/3977124f25d053f5ddc9f7047a192528.webm?t=1787230575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/335d8484785873ea1a2ce92e1f0a8187.avif?t=1787230575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/335d8484785873ea1a2ce92e1f0a8187.webp?t=1787230575 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An entirely original, handcrafted high fantasy universe (No generative AI).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rid the Vale of Vahrin of the many vicious threats that plague it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Seek out the many puzzles, challenges and secrets hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customise your armour, weapons, spells, potions, traps and everything else at your disposal to develop your ideal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Large array of character creation options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full voice acting (English) (No generative AI).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ultrawide monitor support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• DLSS 3.1.11 and FSR 2.2 support</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/54edadf5954952f8c8d9141424a3b9e6.avif?t=1787230575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/54edadf5954952f8c8d9141424a3b9e6.webp?t=1787230575 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise weapons, armour, abilities, alchemy ingredients, traps and anything else you can lay your hands on within an entirely classless character progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to be a nimble-footed archer flinging fireballs between arrows or face your foes, toe to toe as an axe-wielding whirlwind of death; the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/77cf3d53361ddf2f67d82d4be3c978f7.poster.avif?t=1787230575\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/77cf3d53361ddf2f67d82d4be3c978f7.webm?t=1787230575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p clas